# history and archived under $HELIX_ARCHIVE/retirement-backups/ as
# research-fm-code_2026-09-09/, helix-research_2026-09-09/, report_2026-09-09/.
# Working copies still sit beside some checkouts, so ignore them outright --
# a stale index in the main worktree had all 668 files staged to come back.
research/
report/

.pylibs/
.claude/

